stion/math-academy-id "q-40449" :question/problem "Find the cofactor of ${a}_{13}$ in \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -5 & 1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 1 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -2 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of ${a}_{13}$,  we remove the $1$st row and the $3$rd column:\n\n$$\nA=|\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & 1 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ 0 & 2 & ∗ & 1 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 7 & ∗ & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -5 & ∗ & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & ∗ & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{13}=|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the cofactor of ${a}_{13}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{13} & =(-1)^{1+3}{M}_{13} \\\\  & ={M}_{13} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-40449/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-40449"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-131123/selection/42aff35720b567089407a2a0cf7c70ff6334c9493e4d877ecdcdfa86adae004c" :answer/id #uuid "2964e972-387d-5637-a133-e1e20585a4af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "150" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131123/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "4e7a423e-b3a8-5d87-b517-7deee8d5799d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131123/selection/ac46572169135c39bc2dc1bfb75349ed12f60a1187a3ef59cacec084b49d12ff" :answer/id #uuid "f43b4742-5b36-5cfe-b3dc-c2efec322db2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-23" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131123/selection/23c0b4da815e7ba954fedc5e75955047cfe471feec4d2029849a63511c000fa3" :answer/id #